# "Where X is the number of outlaws you control" is counted as the ability resolves, not as it triggers (CR 608.2h). With Flint and Flamecache
# Gecko (a Lizard Warlock) there are two outlaws when the turn-3 upkeep trigger goes on the stack, but Bot2 answers with Lightning Bolt on
# the Gecko, so only Flint is left when it resolves and 1 card is exiled, not 2: Exile holds exactly one card. Bot1's graveyard holds the Gecko.

